<Base><div class="wrap"><section class="hero"><div><div class="eyebrow">● Your personal recording studio</div><h1>Catch the live.<br/>Keep the moment.</h1><p>Paste a stream link, preview it, and record to your own device. Your local studio also watches saved channels for you.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="http://127.0.0.1:47821/app/">Open local studio</a><a class="textlink" href="/app/">Use hosted studio</a></div><div class="caption">Local-first by design &nbsp; / &nbsp; Open source &nbsp; / &nbsp; No cloud account</div></div><div><div class="mock" aria-label="Illustration of the FanSnipe studio"><div class="mocktop"><span>● &nbsp; FANSNIPE / STUDIO</span><span>YOUR LIBRARY</span></div><div class="screen"><div class="play">▶</div></div><div class="mockrow"><span>YOUR NEXT FAVORITE MOMENT<br/><small>SYNTHETIC PREVIEW · NOT A LIVE RECORDING</small></span><span>● &nbsp; READY</span></div><div class="wave">{Array.from({length:75},(_,i)=><i style={`height:${5+((i*17)%29)}px`}></i>)}</div></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="eyebrow">01 / Built around your library</div><h2>Less watching the clock.<br/>More watching what matters.</h2><div class="features"><article class="feature"><b>01 / MONITOR</b><h3>Stay in the loop.</h3><p>Add channels and let the companion check when they go live. Turn automatic recording on only where you want it.</p></article><article class="feature"><b>02 / RECORD</b><h3>Capture on your terms.</h3><p>Start a recording yourself or let your saved channels do the work. Your companion handles the recording locally.</p></article><article class="feature"><b>03 / REVISIT</b><h3>Make it a collection.</h3><p>Find, play and download recordings from one calm workspace. Your files remain under your control.</p></article></div></section><section class="section band"><div><div class="eyebrow">02 / Local by design</div><h2>Your machine.<br/>Your recordings.</h2><p class="lead">The portal talks to a companion on your device. No FanSnipe cloud account, and no media sent to Fanclan or Vercel.</p></div><a class="button" href="/docs/">Meet the companion ↗</a></section></div></Base>
